\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18Today, life won\u8217\'20\'19: gleeful Republicans \u8216\'20\'18praise the Lord\u8217\'20\'19 after  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  ruling\b0\par\par\uc2 Victoria Bekiempis \par \uc2 714 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 June 2022\par 18:04 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2022.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Lawmakers react with joy after Roe v Wade overturned, with Texas attorney general \uc2 Ken Paxton\uc2  declaring an \u8216\'20\'18annual holiday\u8217\'20\'19\par \par \uc2 Shortly after the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  overturned {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/roe-v-wade"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Roe v Wade}}}\uc2  and removed the federal right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in America, Republican officials and politicians and conservative figures began reacting with glee.\par \par \uc2 Several referenced their belief in God \u8211\'20\'13 including one in a public press release \u8211\'20\'13 while at least one declared a holiday.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis is the day the Lord has made; let us rejoice in it and be glad. Today, along with millions across Louisiana and America, I rejoice with my departed Mom and the unborn children with her in Heaven!\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.ag.state.la.us/Article/13044"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  Louisiana\u8217\'20\'19s attorney general, \uc2 Jeff Landry\uc2 , in an official statement.\par \par \uc2 Louisiana\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban went into effect right after Roe was overturned. The law prohibits most abortions and makes providing them illegal. There is no exception for rape or incest, regardless of the female\u8217\'20\'19s age, according to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nola.com/news/healthcare_hospitals/article_ba416134-e8e7-11ec-b6e2-8f8cd0d27442.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Nola.com}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The exceptions include an extreme risk of death or potential for disability. State lawmakers previously voted to criminalize internet or mail-based purchase of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills, the website said.\par \par \uc2 Texas attorney general \uc2 Ken Paxton\uc2  relished the Roe decision, similarly invoking his religion.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CScotus just overruled Roe and Casey, ending one of the most morally and legally corrupt eras in US history. Praise the Lord.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C\b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is now illegal in Texas,\u8221\'20\'1D Paxton {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/KenPaxtonTX/status/1540339215581470723"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tweeted}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CAnd today I\u8217\'20\'19m closing my office \u8211\'20\'13 and making it an annual holiday \u8211\'20\'13 as a memorial to the 70 million lives lost bc of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 In South Dakota, where a trigger law has now made all abortions illegal \u8220\'20\'1Cunless there is appropriate and reasonable medical judgment that performance of an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is necessary to preserve the life of the pregnant female,\u8221\'20\'1D Governor Kristi Noem also invoked religion in praising the court decision.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe have prayed for this day, and now it\u8217\'20\'19s here,\u8221\'20\'1D Noemi {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/govkristinoem/status/1540354378950926336"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said }}}\uc2  on \uc2 Twitter\uc2 , also announcing a special legislative session later this year purportedly \u8220\'20\'1Cto save lives and help mothers\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Former vice president \uc2 Mike Pence\uc2  reacted to the decision by saying: \u8220\'20\'1CToday, life won.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBy overturning Roe v Wade, the supreme court of the United States has given the American people a new beginning for life and I commend the justices in the majority for having the courage of their convictions,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Mike_Pence/status/1540337828873154560"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  on \uc2 Twitter\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBy returning the question of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  to the states and the people, this supreme court has righted a historic wrong, and reaffirmed to right of the American people to govern themselves at the state level in a manner consistent with their values and aspirations.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Pence also used the decision as a call to action for a nation-wise ban on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CHaving been given this second chance for life, we must not rest and must not relent until the sanctity of life is restored to the center of American law in every state in the land,\u8221\'20\'1D he said.\par \par \uc2 In Oklahoma, which has the US\u8217\'20\'19s most restrictive \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban, governor \uc2 Kevin Stitt\uc2  said \u8220\'20\'1CI am very excited that the supreme court made this courageous decision.\u8221\'20\'1D Stitt, echoing many Republicans\u8217\'20\'19 views that \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  will be banned elsewhere, also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/GovStitt?ref_src=twsrc%5Egoogle%7Ctwcamp%5Eserp%7Ctwgr%5Eauthor"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said: }}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19m looking forward to the rest of the country following Oklahoma\u8217\'20\'19s lead to protect life.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Oklahoma\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Okla_OAG?ref_src=twsrc%5Egoogle%7Ctwcamp%5Eserp%7Ctwgr%5Eauthor"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 attorney general}}}\uc2 , John O\u8217\'20\'19Connor, said: \u8220\'20\'1CThis is truly a day for celebration and Thanksgiving.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Far-right Georgia congresswoman Marjorie Taylor Green posted a video with Tennessee congressman Tim Burchett, with the caption \u8220\'20\'1CWe are rejoicing on Capitol Hill!\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe\u8217\'20\'19re just so thankful for the brave supreme court justices and President Trump for nominating them and putting them on the supreme court, so this day could finally come,\u8221\'20\'1D she {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/RepMTG?ref_src=twsrc%5Egoogle%7Ctwcamp%5Eserp%7Ctwgr%5Eauthor"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  in the video posted to \uc2 Twitter\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI couldn\u8217\'20\'19t be happier, couldn\u8217\'20\'19t be happier,\u8221\'20\'1D Burchett said.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COur hearts are full,\u8221\'20\'1D Greene also said, thanking everyone who \u8220\'20\'1Cprayed and protested and written letters and just everything that you\u8217\'20\'19ve always done.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Greene urged supporters \u8220\'20\'1Cdon\u8217\'20\'19t give up the fight \u8230\'20\'26 Don\u8217\'20\'19t forget, there are states like New York that have laws to kill babies up until the day of birth \u8211\'20\'13 those are the places that we need to really do the work.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020220624ei6o002s2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
