\par\par \uc2 World news\par \b \uc2 El Salvador: woman sentenced to 30 years in prison for homicide after miscarriage\b0\par\par\uc2 Staff and agencies in San Salvador \par \uc2 439 \uc2 words\par \uc2 11 May 2022\par 10:22 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2022.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Activists say case offers a stark warning to women in the US, where the supreme court is considering overturning Roe v Wade\par \par \uc2 A court in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/el-salvador"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 El Salvador}}}\uc2  has sentenced a woman who suffered a miscarriage to 30 years in prison for aggravated homicide, in a case which activists said offers a stark warning to women in the United States, where the supreme court is considering overturning a key ruling which legalized \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The woman, identified only as \u8220\'20\'1CEsme\u8221\'20\'1D, was sentenced on Monday, after nearly two years under pre-trial detention, following her arrest when she sought medical care in a public hospital.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CEsme\u8217\'20\'19s sentencing is a devastating step backward for the progress that has been made in the unlawful criminalization of women suffering obstetric emergencies in El Salvador,\u8221\'20\'1D said Paula Avila-Guillen, international human rights lawyer and executive director of the Women\u8217\'20\'19s Equality Center.\par \par \uc2 Avila-Guillen warned that as the United States faces the possible overturning of Roe v Wade \u8211\'20\'13 the 1973 supreme court ruling that effectively legalised \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  \u8211\'20\'13 similar cases will become more common across the world.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe have seen repeatedly throughout Latin America that when \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is criminalized, women are made to prove that any one of the wide range of obstetric emergencies they experience were in fact emergencies. When they can\u8217\'20\'19t or don\u8217\'20\'19t have the resources to do so or are simply not believed, they face imprisonment,\u8221\'20\'1D she said.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CEveryone in the US should have their eyes on El Salvador right now to understand exactly what a future without Roe entails.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Morena Herrera, the president of The Citizens\u8217\'20\'19 Group for the Decriminalization of \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  described the sentence as \u8220\'20\'1Ca heavy blow\u8221\'20\'1D, and called for miscarriages to be treated as a public health issue rather than a criminal one.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe will continue to fight so that all women unjustly criminalized by these circumstances regain their freedom and have the opportunity to remake and rebuild their lives,\u8221\'20\'1D she said.\par \par \uc2 El Salvador has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/global-development/2015/dec/17/el-salvador-anti-abortion-law-premature-birth-miscarriage-attempted-murder"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 some of the world\u8217\'20\'19s most draconian \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  laws}}}\uc2 , with a total ban on the procedure. Unlike in many other Latin American countries, El Salvador does not permit \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in cases where the child is conceived by rape or incest, or where the health of the mother or child is at risk.\par \par \uc2 Over the past two decades, more than 180 women have been jailed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/global-development/2016/jul/14/el-salvador-abortion-law-change-women-facing-50-years-jail"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 for murder}}}\uc2  for having an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  after suffering obstetric emergencies, according to rights groups.\par \par \uc2 Since December, eight women serving long prison sentences have had those sentences commuted.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020220511ei5b001mi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
